    "name": "Choosing Between an In-Law Suite, Garage Conversion, and ADU",
    "text": "Choosing Between an In-Law Suite, Garage Conversion, and ADU",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Choose an in-law suite format by matching the household’s privacy, accessibility, cooking, parking, and separation needs to the property’s existing space. An interior suite may be simpler, while a garage conversion, attached addition, or detached ADU can offer greater independence but may require more design, utility, structural, and permit coordination. Compare complete project scopes rather than room-only estimates.",
